        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Claim Jumper, Landry's, Inc.\n- Places: The Willows Shopping Center\n- Retailers/Brands: Old Navy, ULTA Beauty, Cost Plus World Market, REI, UFC Gym, Benihana, Pier One\n\nFacts:\n- Landry's, Inc. is an American, privately owned, multi-brand dining, hospitality, entertainment, and gaming corporation.\n- In holiday 2006, Pier One became the newest member of the retailer lineup at The Willows Shopping Center.\n- The Willows Shopping Center has a lineup of national retailers including Old Navy, ULTA Beauty, Cost Plus World Market, REI, UFC Gym, Claim Jumper, Benihana, and Pier One.\n- Claim Jumper is wholly owned by Landry's, Inc.",
